# Dispute Resolution {#disputes when=forum:courts}

Disputes are resolved by the courts of Prague.

# Dispute Resolution {#disputes when=forum:arbitration}

Disputes are settled under the ICC Rules.

# Interim Relief {#interim-relief}

Nothing in Section {{ref: disputes}} prevents interim relief from {{choose: forum, courts="a competent court"}}.
